e waivers for everyone in your party before arriving in order to speed up the check-in process\n- Motion Sickness-although our vessel is equipped with advanced technology with onboard stabilizers: no vessel is immune to all movement on the water and no one can give a “no seasickness guarantee.” If you are particularly susceptible to motion sickness, we recommend taking motion sickness pills 30 minutes prior to departure. We also sell meclazine onboard and have Seasickness relief bands available for rent.\n- For answers to additional questions, check out our FAQ’s on our website or give us a call!\n__________________________\n##Cancellation Policy\nCancellations made at least 24 hours in advance are eligible for a full refund. Cancellations within 24 hours or no-shows are non-refundable. If we cancel due to weather or sea conditions, you will receive a full refund or the option to reschedule.\nIf you wish to change or cancel your reservation and are within our cancellation period, you can select the option to rebook or cancel towards the top of this email (your confirmation email).\n_________________________\nThank you again for choosing Wild Pacific Whale Watch. We can’t wait to show you the wild side of San Diego from the best seat on the water.\nLet’s Explore the Wild Together  \n- **The Wild Pacific Team** \nContact Us:  📞 (619) 821-8205  \n📧 info@wildpacificwhalewatch.com  \n🌐 www.wildpacificwhalewatch.com", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Great for all ages • 3 - 3.5 Hours", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/wildpacificwhalewatch/items/639191/images/1482481/", "pk": 1482481, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/5VN5yjVgT8CUngdzqQ0A", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/5VN5yjVgT8CUngdzqQ0A", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/comp